  .ForMember(dest => dest.AccountDetails,
             opt  => opt.MapFrom<AccountDetailsJsonResolver>());
```

And in your resolvers you use `src.AccountDetailsJsonRaw` (the **string**)—not a list—to call `JsonSerializer`.

---

### 2) If you store it relationally (no JSON blob):

Remove all the JSON-column stuff and let AutoMapper map the child lists directly:

```csharp
